Goto ReadyX*/
Fire:
8H03 B 0 A_JumpIfInventory("LookAtSueFly",1,"FlyStop")
8H03 B 0 A_JumpIfInventory("UnholyPower1500",1500,"HEYHEYHEY")
8H03 B 0 A_PlaySoundEx("weapons/mm7/freezecrackerfire","Weapon")
8H03 B 2 
