//I HATE THIS//
//Welcome to new rage, AHAHAHAHAHA-- witness how half-assed it is!
//8I15 BCBCBCBC 2 Offset(-44,-36)A_GiveInventory("MagicDevilEye_RageFX_P",1) //
/*"I'd like to point out this is one of the most server intensive rages I've made.
Not intentionally, mind you. But I had no clue. So for the sake of things, it's time
and try to do something else ! Whatever original code there was is now changed-dayo!
So, here's hoping this new attempt isn't... as intensive." - Trist 2024
*/


HEYHEYHEY: //38 tics anticipation time.
