TNT1 AAAAAA 2 A_GiveInventory("SueBlizzard_Rage_P",1)*/
Goto SessionEnd
SessionEnd:
TNT1 A 14 A_WeaponReady(14)
8H03 A 0 ACS_NamedExecuteWithResult("core_stopplayer", 0, false)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,100)  
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,70)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,50)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,45)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,39)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,35)
8H03 A 1 Offset(0,33)
